      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Automatic updates</b> with Sparkle: Landfall checks once a day for signed, notarized updates from GitHub, notifies you without interrupting, and offers &quot;Update to …&quot; in the menu. Settings › General › Updates has the switches and a Check Now button. Install this version manually once; later versions arrive by themselves.</li>
</ul>
